    "evidenceLimit": "Runtime proof of Windows API interop, real profile SID, actual child token, zero capabilities, low integrity, and suspended termination. Does not modify compiler-generated PE imports, invoke the Sharnou native emitter, or establish production broker readiness.",
    "evidence": "The fixture makes no command-line, executable path, environment, or tool choice user/model configurable. It has no ResumeThread import or call. The only child image is %SystemRoot%\\System32\\whoami.exe, started CREATE_SUSPENDED and terminated before its primary thread runs."
  },
  "testFixturePolicy": [
    "The test-only AppContainer fixture must use the genuine PSID returned by CreateAppContainerProfile; a SID-shaped caller string is never accepted as evidence.",
    "The per-execution DACL grants the broker supervisor and SYSTEM FullControl, and the AppContainer package SID only the exact scratch mask 0x0013019F.",
    "The scratch mask deliberately excludes FILE_EXECUTE, DELETE_CHILD, WRITE_DAC and WRITE_OWNER; DACL inheritance is protected and every ACE is explicitly checked.",
    "Before restoring or deleting a workspace, the corresponding child process must be terminated and waited; this fixture does so before crash-recovery replay.",
    "The journal root, shared workspace parent, another execution workspace, compiler-source sentinel and broker-image sentinel must deny the AppContainer token.",
    "The journal retains the original owner/group/DACL SDDL before restrictive DACL mutation. Recovery must restore and verify that exact SDDL before removing the workspace.",
    "This test fixture does not integrate the production native process emitter or Job Object; process-tree termination coordination remains a production integration requirement."
  ],
