      "filtering": "Only SystemRoot/WINDIR and drive-current-directory entries for drives used by the fixed child SystemDirectory and supervisor working directory are copied. PATH is reset to System32; TEMP/TMP are set to the runner temp directory.",
      "bounds": "Maximum 32768 UTF-16 code units; terminate on double NUL; always release source block with FreeEnvironmentStringsW."
